{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAM! Punch enemies to the building and destroy it !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300b is a first-person superpowered combat game that focuses on high-speed battles, environmental destruction, and uniquely designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using your fists\u2014charge up your punches to send enemies flying with shockwaves and air pressure, creating exaggerated knockback effects. Smash them into buildings, causing massive explosions and large-scale environmental destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all enemies and NPCs can be punched into the air, and most buildings in the world can be destroyed\u2014from streetlights and water towers to even skyscrapers and mountains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain new abilities and unlock different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can acquire three distinct superpowers: <strong>Force, Lightning, and Fire</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force</strong> enables powerful melee combos with devastating impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning</strong> summons thunderbolts to weaken enemy resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> unleashes explosive attacks to break enemy shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat against different types of superpowered foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>10 unique boss fights</strong> and elite enemies, each possessing their own special abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are as fast as lightning, making them hard to hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some command thunder, summoning devastating strikes at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some possess immense physical strength and can send the player flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are enhanced by technology, wielding advanced firearms and energy weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed, players must <strong>adapt their strategies</strong> and <strong>make the most of their superpowers to counter each enemy\u2019s abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS &amp; LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to defeat enemies or complete challenges, then enter a portal to progress to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>diverse, linear levels</strong>\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering <strong>cyberpunk neon cities</strong> to <strong>decaying post-apocalyptic ruins</strong>. Leap between <strong>floating islands inspired by Eastern mythology</strong>, or use your abilities to launch yourself like a rocket, navigating through <strong>satellite cities in the upper atmosphere</strong>. Master your powers to reach and explore every corner of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300bis a <strong>solo-developed indie game</strong>, aiming to create a brand-new <strong>first-person superpowered combat experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your feedback and support through <strong>Discord, X (Twitter), or other social media</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408440?t=1770909641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/9745c9ae32452b695764ceaa47192fe2f9cb598b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770909641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/4f43589ffecfcc6f9d87af9d0f7a3a56fe5bc798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770909641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/4f43589ffecfcc6f9d87af9d0f7a3a56fe5bc798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770909641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3546890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAM! Punch enemies to the building and destroy it !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300b is a first-person superpowered combat game that focuses on high-speed battles, environmental destruction, and uniquely designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/bc16d260ce69c13fda7a9b9078b54031.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using your fists\u2014charge up your punches to send enemies flying with shockwaves and air pressure, creating exaggerated knockback effects. Smash them into buildings, causing massive explosions and large-scale environmental destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all enemies and NPCs can be punched into the air, and most buildings in the world can be destroyed\u2014from streetlights and water towers to even skyscrapers and mountains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain new abilities and unlock different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can acquire three distinct superpowers: <strong>Force, Lightning, and Fire</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force</strong> enables powerful melee combos with devastating impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning</strong> summons thunderbolts to weaken enemy resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> unleashes explosive attacks to break enemy shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat against different types of superpowered foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>10 unique boss fights</strong> and elite enemies, each possessing their own special abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are as fast as lightning, making them hard to hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some command thunder, summoning devastating strikes at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some possess immense physical strength and can send the player flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are enhanced by technology, wielding advanced firearms and energy weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed, players must <strong>adapt their strategies</strong> and <strong>make the most of their superpowers to counter each enemy\u2019s abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.poster.avif?t=1770909641\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.webm?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.mp4?t=1770909641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS &amp; LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to defeat enemies or complete challenges, then enter a portal to progress to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>diverse, linear levels</strong>\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering <strong>cyberpunk neon cities</strong> to <strong>decaying post-apocalyptic ruins</strong>. Leap between <strong>floating islands inspired by Eastern mythology</strong>, or use your abilities to launch yourself like a rocket, navigating through <strong>satellite cities in the upper atmosphere</strong>. Master your powers to reach and explore every corner of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1770909641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras_big/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1770909641 width=800 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300bis a <strong>solo-developed indie game</strong>, aiming to create a brand-new <strong>first-person superpowered combat experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your feedback and support through <strong>Discord, X (Twitter), or other social media</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lonelyma Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/header.jpg?t=1770909641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408440/833396/0da55cbdea9fe710543fef6ee9bf65c9ffa9abb4/1750848165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740237938","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408440/833396/0da55cbdea9fe710543fef6ee9bf65c9ffa9abb4/1750848165/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740237938","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408440/833396/0da55cbdea9fe710543fef6ee9bf65c9ffa9abb4/1750848165/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740237938","id":257101060,"name":"Boss battle presentation","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101060/ab28e3c151e6a2da85d691b02ee818bb79577c96/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740237938"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408440/800